WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.539
Today we will reuse materials while arranging an image. Our work connects with other

00:00:05.539 --> 00:00:06.301
Ghanaian communities.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:10.679
Sort clean paper by colour and select pieces for your picture.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:14.413
Arrange pieces on cardboard before applying glue.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.404
Stick the pieces down and explain the main image. Compare your result with a second

00:00:20.404 --> 00:00:21.379
example from Ghana.
